{"id":234,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"少人数指導と探究で自分発見を支える帝京大学","feature_description":"帝京大学中学校では、4クラス編成と学年担当教員の配置により、一人ひとりの学習や進路を支える少人数教育を行います。中学1年の2学期から数学・英語で習熟度別授業を実施し、中学3年から始まる高校内容の先取りに備えます。自主学習への添削や質問・相談への対応も重視し、生徒が自分の弱点を把握して学びを深めるよう支援しています。質問や相談をしやすい環境も整えています。","clubs":[{"id":5041,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5042,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5043,"name":"中国拳法部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5044,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5045,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5046,"name":"競技かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5047,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5048,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5049,"name":"南米音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5050,"name":"天文気象部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5051,"name":"映画研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5052,"name":"社会研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5053,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo-u.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15